<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Lower memory use with many stickers and emoji: each sticker's data is kept once instead of twice&lt;br&gt;• Closed widgets release their last frame, and photo thumbnails read their file only once&lt;br&gt;• Custom emoji appear faster right after launch&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Images, avatars and emoji could stop loading everywhere after scrolling the emoji panel, and pasting a screenshot could do nothing&lt;br&gt;• Profile buttons stretch again and gifts can be dragged on profiles&lt;br&gt;</description>
